Yeah, well, this sniveling weasel's gonna pop you off.

320
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,420
Hey, hey, hey, guys, guys, come on.

321
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,460
You're fighting over a girl.

322
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:23,520
All right, now, I'm just saving for the important stuff, like who gets the remote

323
