331
00:16:45,640 --> 00:16:46,820
Cheryl adored me.

332
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:48,920
She worshiped at the Shrine O 'Ben.

333
00:16:50,140 --> 00:16:50,980
Oh, no, come on.

334
00:16:51,020 --> 00:16:54,180
Do you think that's really fair to use some girl like that to stroke your own ego?

335
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:58,900
Of course. Ben, what if some girl was doing the same thing to you?

336
00:17:00,420 --> 00:17:02,040
Oh, whoa, I'm starting to sound like Dad.

337
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:04,760
How's my hair?

338
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:09,560
Mike, she made me feel important.

339
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:12,200
I mean, all my life, I've been Siever's little brother.

340
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:14,120
I mean, that's all I ever heard.

341
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,840
I'm finally out of your shadow.

342
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:17,480
Now I'm the kid who lives with Luke.

343
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:22,200
I mean, he gets better grades than me, looks better in my clothes, and I choke on

344
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:27,080
his mushrooms. He's even stealing the advice you should be giving me.

345
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:29,640
You're my brother, not Luke's.

346
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:41,100
Oh. ["The Star -Spangled Banner"] ["The Star -Spangled Banner"]

347
00:17:43,020 --> 00:17:44,520
["The Star -Spangled Banner"] Hi.

348
00:17:45,180 --> 00:17:47,300
Hi, honey. How was school?

349
