I even drew pictures.

352
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:53,020
Oh, how nice.

353
00:17:53,060 --> 00:17:54,280
That's very imaginative.

354
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,860
Yeah, it was great.

355
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:57,560
First, I told him what Daddy does.

356
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:02,900
I said he takes women into his office, closes the door, and make them lay on the

