377
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:21,560
Or you can make things the way they used to be.

378
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:23,000
The way they used to be?

379
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:28,200
Me, hanging around in your locker, doing your homework, hoping that just once you'd

380
