No, no, I'm going.

426
00:21:49,980 --> 00:21:51,600
Luke, you live here.

427
00:21:52,740 --> 00:21:57,740
Oh. Well, see ya.

428
00:21:57,740 --> 00:22:02,340
Look, Cheryl, there are two ways I can play this.

429
00:22:02,860 --> 00:22:06,180
I can spend the next three years ignoring you until you're crazed with desire for

430
00:22:06,180 --> 00:22:09,260
