434
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:22,040
Okay. Two words.

435
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:26,300
Sadie Hawkins. One word.

436
00:22:26,300 --> 00:22:30,220
Yes. Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh!

437
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,640
LAUGHTER
